 class="xajkehx">Hardware, colocation and connectivity from a single account team.</p></div><div class="carrier-neutral-idcs xlk418x fb"><p class="xmxtt3h">Carrier-Neutral IDCs</p><p class="xajkehx">Deploy inside facilities Vocom already operates across Asia-Pacific and the Americas.</p></div><div class="bandwidth-on-tap xlk418x fb"><p class="xmxtt3h">Bandwidth on Tap</p><p class="xajkehx">Scale network capacity alongside compute as training and inference load grows.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="netmap-wrap"><NetworkMap /></div><div class="section-divider xbstc8l"><div class="x2h0iev"></div><div class="xqo6eaw"></div><div class="x2h0iev"></div></div><div class="4 xs4tdkn"><div class="xmrbb9j"><h3 class="h3 x10uerp">One Network, Three Business Lines</h3><p class="xq9pbwc">The same backbone and the same NOC behind every service</p></div><div class="xgbie5l"><div class="xkgm4hh masonry"><div class="xuqg4y9"><h5 class="h5 xxf1z1r">1998</h5><p class="xfxcabm">FCC 214 Licensed</p></div><div class="xd6smxn"><p class="xpjutxz">20+</p><p class="xfxcabm">Global PoPs and IDCs</p></div><div class="xd6smxn"><p class="xpjutxz">3</p><p class="xfxcabm">Core Business Lines</p></div><div class="xd6smxn"><h5 class="h5 xxf1z1r">24/7</h5><p class="xfxcabm">NOC Monitoring</p></div></div></div></div><div class="carousel xctiiw2"><div class="h2 xlsdbpm"><div class="xrebnwx"><h3 class="h3 x10uerp">Frequently Asked Questions</h3><p class="xq9pbwc">Get Answers to Your Queries</p></div></div><div class="xirfgyp"><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="What regions do you serve?">VOCOM's core services are concentrated in cross-Pacific destinations, with China, Hong Kong and Taiwan carrying particular emphasis, plus active routes into India, Australia, the Middle East, Europe and the Americas across 20+ PoPs and IDCs.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="Do you offer a dedicated China route?">Yes. China connectivity is engineered per carrier rather than as a single blended feed, across China Telecom, China Unicom and China Mobile, with a tunable mix route to match each customer's traffic profile.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="What support do you offer?">The same NOC that runs IP transit and MPLS also watches Anti-DDoS and voice routes, 24/7, with a dedicated system integration team for on-site deployments.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="Do you handle the physical deployment too?">Yes. A dedicated project management and technical team handles consulting, equipment procurement, logistics, installation, cabling, debugging and troubleshooting for overseas builds, end to end.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="How long has Vocom been in telecommunications?">Vocom was founded in 1998, with a focus on cross-Pacific and Asia-Pacific connectivity.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="Do you offer IEPL and IPLC private circuits?">Yes. Vocom provides <a href="/iepl-iplc-private-leased-circuits" class="text-link">IEPL and IPLC private leased circuits</a> on cross-Pacific and Asia-Pacific routes, including India to Australia and other APAC point-to-point lanes, sized from sub-1 Gbps access links up to 10 Gbps and above. Contact us with your endpoints and bandwidth requirement.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="Do you provide IP transit and dark fiber in Asia-Pacific?">Yes. Alongside private circuits, Vocom provides IP transit, dark fiber and data center connectivity across the region. Contact us to discuss coverage for your locations.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="How do I contact sales?">Use the <a href="/contact-vocomai" class="text-link">contact page</a> to reach the team. Tell us what you need and where, and we will respond with next steps.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="What bandwidth options are available for IEPL/IPLC circuits?">IEPL and IPLC circuits are sized to the traffic profile you send us, from sub-1 Gbps access links up to 10 Gbps and above for high-capacity point-to-point routes such as India to Australia. Send your two endpoints and the bandwidth you need and we will return a sized quote.</FaqItem></div></div></div><div class="box xcezkca"><div class="xighwjk"><div class="h2 x6idugm"><div class="xptnlxu"><h3 class="h3 xgb5x2y">Ready to Elevate Your Connectivity?</h3><p class="subtext xqwkm7f">Tell us your route requirements, we will size the connection before you commit to anything.</p></div></div><a class="button-primary x6tj6kj" href="/contact-vocomai"><p class="xl4u3rf">Get Started Now</p></a></div></div><div class="section-divider xbstc8l"><div class="x2h0iev"></div><div class="xqo6eaw"></div><div class="x2h0iev"></div></div><div class="simple-footer-2 xzxrxrs footer-slot" data-pagefind-ignore><Footer footerTagline="Leading telecommunications provider focused on cross-Pacific connectivity." title="Quick Links" menu1="Home" menu2="VOCOM AI" menu3="RenOS AI Agents" link1="/" link3="/vocom-ai-agents" /></div></div>
